# 10: a bounce from SET (a take), with its progress.
title A BOUNCE
about On SET, the BOUNCE row makes the song into a WAV file while you carry on. Each bounce is a fresh TAKE: chance and the dice roll again.
caption SET: BOUNCE
run --demo --view bounce-ready
from 0.5
length 18.0

0.7 say SET, the BOUNCE row: the song made into a WAV file.
2.0 say Left and right pick what: the whole song, each track, this track...
2.2 tap RIGHT 3 0.6
4.4 tap LEFT 3 0.3
5.8 say Each bounce is a fresh TAKE: chance and the dice roll again.
7.2 say A starts it. The song plays on while it works.
7.4 tap A
9.0 say WORKING: how much of the song is done. Then TAIL: until the echoes die away.
12.2 say Done: the next press makes TAKE 2.
13.8 say Hold A and press down: an earlier take, to make it again.
13.8 hold A 2.4
14.4 tap DOWN
